    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. lemme double check i got it right. so if he needs 600mg total in a day and i give him 3.75ml twice, that's like 7.5ml total a day right? and since 7.5ml is only 600mg... wait, i think i'm getting mixed up. if the bottle is 400mg per 5ml, how many ml is actually 600mg? i need to be 100% sure before i give it to him.",
